Notice on bundled and third-party material
==========================================

The implementation under src/, scripts/, and tests/ is covered by the MIT license in LICENSE.

WANDS (Wayfair ANnotation Dataset)
  Not redistributed. Fetch it from the official source (https://github.com/wayfair/WANDS, MIT license)
  and verify it against the frozen manifest in data_manifests/wands.json.

Frozen label tapes
  cache/labels_wands.sqlite, cache/labels_uci.sqlite, reports/second_model_20261103/labels_wands_second_model.sqlite
  They hold record identifiers and binary labels computed with local open-weight Qwen3 models over a WANDS
  subset (and over the UCI sentences); they carry no source text. The WANDS tapes are released under the same
  MIT terms as the underlying data; the UCI tape derives from data released under CC BY 4.0 (see below).

UCI Sentiment Labelled Sentences (data/uci/*.txt)
  Redistributed under CC BY 4.0 (https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/331/sentiment+labelled+sentences).
  Original authors: D. Kotzias, M. Denil, N. de Freitas, P. Smyth, "From Group to Individual Labels using
  Deep Features", KDD 2015.

